{"repo_path": "platform/packages/providers/MediaProvider", "commit_hash": "747431250612507e8289ae8eb1a56303e79ab678", "author_name": "Sergey Nikolaienkov", "author_email": "sergeynv@google.com", "commit_time": "Tue Mar 28 12:22:31 2023 +0200", "commit_message": "Fix path traversal vulnerabilities in MediaProvider\n\nCanonicalize filepath provided by the caller when hanling SCAN_FILE_CALL\nmethod call in MediaProvider.\nAdditionally, make sure to check access permission in SCAN_FILE_CALL\n(using enforceCallingPermissionInternal()).\n\nPreemptively canonicalize Files provided as an arguments to the public\nAPI methods in ModernMediaScanner (scanFile(), scanDirectory() and\nonDirectoryDirty()) to prevent path traversal attacks.\n\nBug: 262244882\nTest: atest MediaProviderTests\n(cherry picked from https://googleplex-android-review.googlesource.com/q/commit:5bb32d7fba00b9e53c7e20ae8acaf6f84a8b2e8d)\nMerged-In: I61e77d69ae857984b819fa0ea27bec5c26a34842\nChange-Id: I61e77d69ae857984b819fa0ea27bec5c26a34842", "changed_files": [{"type": "modify", "old_path": "src/com/android/providers/media/MediaProvider.java", "new_path": "src/com/android/providers/media/MediaProvider.java"}, {"type": "modify", "old_path": "src/com/android/providers/media/scan/LegacyMediaScanner.java", "new_path": "src/com/android/providers/media/scan/LegacyMediaScanner.java"}, {"type": "modify", "old_path": "src/com/android/providers/media/scan/MediaScanner.java", "new_path": "src/com/android/providers/media/scan/MediaScanner.java"}, {"type": "modify", "old_path": "src/com/android/providers/media/scan/ModernMediaScanner.java", "new_path": "src/com/android/providers/media/scan/ModernMediaScanner.java"}, {"type": "modify", "old_path": "src/com/android/providers/media/scan/NullMediaScanner.java", "new_path": "src/com/android/providers/media/scan/NullMediaScanner.java"}, {"type": "modify", "old_path": "src/com/android/providers/media/util/FileUtils.java", "new_path": "src/com/android/providers/media/util/FileUtils.java"}, {"type": "modify", "old_path": "tests/src/com/android/providers/media/scan/LegacyMediaScannerTest.java", "new_path": "tests/src/com/android/providers/media/scan/LegacyMediaScannerTest.java"}, {"type": "modify", "old_path": "tests/src/com/android/providers/media/scan/ModernMediaScannerTest.java", "new_path": "tests/src/com/android/providers/media/scan/ModernMediaScannerTest.java"}, {"type": "modify", "old_path": "tests/src/com/android/providers/media/scan/NullMediaScannerTest.java", "new_path": "tests/src/com/android/providers/media/scan/NullMediaScannerTest.java"}]}